{"id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md","title":"Finite Sequence","display":"df-finite-sequence — Finite Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-finite-sequence","aliases":["58-df-finite-sequence","58-df-Seq"],"display":"df-finite-sequence — Finite Sequence","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-finite-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-finite-sequence</span><span>58-df-Seq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-sequence — Finite Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in V\">\\(D\\in V\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in V\">\\(s\\in V\\)</span>（函数图候选）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,D)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,D)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite-sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,D)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite-sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,D)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(D^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是论域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 上的有限序列集合</li>\n<li>序列用于表示图灵机的计算历史</li>\n<li>编码使用 Cantor 配对函数的多次迭代：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle s_0, \\ldots, s_{n-1}\\rangle \\mapsto \\prod_{i &lt; n} p_i^{s_i + 1}\">\\(\\langle s_0, \\ldots, s_{n-1}\\rangle \\mapsto \\prod_{i &lt; n} p_i^{s_i + 1}\\)</span></li>\n<li>素数序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0 = 2, p_1 = 3, p_2 = 5, \\ldots\">\\(p_0 = 2, p_1 = 3, p_2 = 5, \\ldots\\)</span> 用于编码有限序列。</li>\n<li>所有原始递归函数可编码为有限序列</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\in V$ 与 $n\\in\\omega$（see [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,D)$（see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite-sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,D)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"D^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle s_0, \\ldots, s_{n-1}\\rangle \\mapsto \\prod_{i < n} p_i^{s_i + 1}","display":false},{"tex":"p_0 = 2, p_1 = 3, p_2 = 5, \\ldots","display":false}],"bytes":1104,"backlinks":[{"id":"74261e48e94a4d06","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"961cbe63813f3f0d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tree},\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]], [[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]])"},{"id":"eb94cd034539276b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]])"},{"id":"2a48a890cd9aeba0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{s\\mid\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,X)\\}$（see [[58-df-finite-sequence]]）"},{"id":"04028314a0510b33","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSeq}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[5